  Select Model and Effort
  Access legacy models by running opencli -m <model_name> or in your config.to

› 1. gpt-5.2-opencli (default)  Latest frontier agentic coding model.
  2. gpt-5.2                    Latest frontier model with improvements across
                                knowledge, reasoning and coding
  3. gpt-5.1-opencli-max        OpenCLI-optimized flagship for deep and fast
                                reasoning.
  4. gpt-5.1-opencli-mini       Optimized for opencli. Cheaper, faster, but
                                less capable.
  5. GLM 5.2                    GLM 5.2 via CheapestInference (default).
  6. MiniMax M3                 MiniMax M3 via CheapestInference.
  7. DeepSeek V4 Flash          DeepSeek V4 Flash via CheapestInference (Core
                                pool).
  8. MiMo v2.5                  MiMo v2.5 via CheapestInference (Core pool).

  Press enter to select reasoning effort, or esc to dismiss.
